# PulsePoll Project Configuration Overview
# PulsePoll consists of a Go/Gin backend and a React/Vite frontend.
# Individual configurations reside in backend/.env and frontend/.env.
# See backend/.env.example and frontend/.env.example for details.

# Backend summary:
# PORT=8080
# MONGODB_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017
# REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6380
# JWT_SECRET=your-secret-here
# ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173

# Frontend summary:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8080/api
# VITE_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8080/ws
